{"id":30011,"artist":"Ed Sheeran","title":"Ed Sheeran - Perfect","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:14.62] I found a love, for me\r\n[00:21.54] Darling, just dive right in and follow my lead\r\n[00:29.11] Well, I found a girl, beautiful and sweet\r\n[00:33.94] Oh, I never knew you were the someone waiting for me\r\n[00:38.91] 'Cause we were just kids when we fell in love\r\n[00:42.16] Not knowing what it was\r\n[00:44.62] I will not give you up this time\r\n[00:49.73] But darling, just kiss me slow\r\n[00:52.56] Your heart is all I own\r\n[00:52.61] And in your eyes, you're holding mine\r\n[00:52.61] Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\r\n[00:52.61] With you between my arms\r\n[00:52.61] Barefoot on the grass\r\n[00:52.61] Listening to our favourite song\r\n[00:52.61] When you said you looked a mess\r\n[00:52.80] I whispered underneath my breath\r\n[00:52.80] But you heard it\r\n[00:52.80] Darling, you look perfect tonight\r\n[00:52.80] \r\n[00:52.80] Well, I found a woman, stronger than anyone I know\r\n[00:52.80] She shares my dreams, I hope that someday I'll share her home\r\n[00:52.80] I found a lover, to carry more than just my secrets\r\n[00:52.80] To carry love, to carry children of our own\r\n[00:52.80] We are still kids, but we're so in love\r\n[00:52.80] Fighting against all odds\r\n[00:52.80] I know we'll be alright this time\r\n[00:52.80] Darling, just hold my hand\r\n[00:52.80] Be my girl, I'll be your man\r\n[00:52.80] I see my future in your eyes\r\n[00:52.80] Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\r\n[00:53.03] With you between my arms\r\n[00:53.03] Barefoot on the grass\r\n[00:53.03] Listening to our favorite song\r\n[00:53.22] When I saw you in that dress, looking so beautiful\r\n[00:54.89] I don't deserve this\r\n[00:57.35] Darling, you look perfect tonight\r\n[01:00.51] \r\n[01:03.01] (No, no, no)\r\n[01:05.52] \r\n[01:07.57] Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\r\n[01:08.68] With you between my arms\r\n[01:10.35] Barefoot on the grass\r\n[01:12.91] Listening to our favorite song\r\n[01:12.91] I have faith in what I see\r\n[01:13.79] Now I know I have met an angel in person\r\n[01:13.79] And she looks perfect\r\n[01:13.79] I don't deserve this\r\n[01:13.79] You look perfect tonight\r\n[01:14.02] ","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:14.62] <00:14.62>I <00:15.62>found <00:16.62>a <00:17.62>love, <00:18.62>for <00:19.62>me\n[00:21.54] <00:21.54>Darling, <00:22.21>just <00:22.87>dive <00:23.54>right <00:24.21>in <00:24.87>and <00:25.54>follow <00:26.21>my <00:26.87>lead\n[00:29.11] <00:29.11>Well, <00:29.71>I <00:30.32>found <00:30.92>a <00:31.52>girl, <00:32.13>beautiful <00:32.73>and <00:33.34>sweet\n[00:33.94] <00:33.94>Oh, <00:34.39>I <00:34.84>never <00:35.30>knew <00:35.75>you <00:36.20>were <00:36.65>the <00:37.10>someone <00:37.55>waiting <00:38.01>for <00:38.46>me\n[00:38.91] <00:38.91>'Cause <00:39.23>we <00:39.56>were <00:39.88>just <00:40.21>kids <00:40.53>when <00:40.86>we <00:41.18>fell <00:41.51>in <00:41.83>love\n[00:42.16] <00:42.16>Not <00:42.65>knowing <00:43.14>what <00:43.64>it <00:44.13>was\n[00:44.62] <00:44.62>I <00:45.26>will <00:45.90>not <00:46.54>give <00:47.17>you <00:47.81>up <00:48.45>this <00:49.09>time\n[00:49.73] <00:49.73>But <00:50.20>darling, <00:50.67>just <00:51.14>kiss <00:51.62>me <00:52.09>slow\n[00:52.56] <00:52.56>Your <00:52.64>heart <00:52.73>is <00:52.81>all <00:52.89>I <00:52.98>own\n[00:52.61] <00:52.61>And <00:52.68>in <00:52.75>your <00:52.82>eyes, <00:52.90>you're <00:52.97>holding <00:53.04>mine\n[00:52.61] <00:52.61>Baby, <00:52.69>I'm <00:52.78>dancing <00:52.86>in <00:52.94>the <00:53.03>dark\n[00:52.61] <00:52.61>With <00:52.71>you <00:52.81>between <00:52.91>my <00:53.01>arms\n[00:52.61] <00:52.61>Barefoot <00:52.73>on <00:52.86>the <00:52.98>grass\n[00:52.61] <00:52.61>Listening <00:52.71>to <00:52.81>our <00:52.91>favourite <00:53.01>song\n[00:52.61] <00:52.61>When <00:52.68>you <00:52.75>said <00:52.82>you <00:52.90>looked <00:52.97>a <00:53.04>mess\n[00:52.80] <00:52.80>